  "helpFaqReplyVoiceSymptoms": "Voice symptoms: tap the microphone, speak your symptoms clearly, and the app converts it to text for analysis.\n\nTips: speak one symptom at a time, use simple words (\"fever\", \"cough\"), and allow microphone permission when asked.",
